!include ../_style.puml

title 影片處理狀態機圖

[*] --> queued : createVideo / initialize processing metadata
queued --> processing : startWebhook [queued] / increment attemptCount
processing --> processing : startWebhook [already processing] / acknowledge replay
queued --> failed : failWebhook [queued] / preserve failure detail
processing --> failed : failWebhook [processing] / preserve failure detail
failed --> failed : failWebhook [already failed] / acknowledge replay
failed --> queued : retry [authorized and failed] / clear error timestamps
processing --> completed : completeWebhook [processing] / save metadata and side effects
completed --> completed : completeWebhook [already completed] / repair idempotent side effects
completed --> [*] : retain / expose ready status

note right of failed
  對應設計類別：Video.processing。
  其他轉換以 409 VIDEO_PROCESSING_TRANSITION_INVALID 拒絕。
end note

@enduml
